@host = https://localhost:7000
@token = dev-token-123

### 1. No token -> 401 {"error":"Unauthorized."} + WWW-Authenticate: Bearer
GET {{host}}/api/users

### 2. Wrong token -> 401
GET {{host}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer wrong-token

### 3. Wrong scheme -> 401
GET {{host}}/api/users
Authorization: Basic dev-token-123

### 4. Empty bearer value -> 401
GET {{host}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer 

### 5. Valid token -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Valid token, missing user -> 404 (handled by endpoint, still logged)
GET {{host}}/api/users/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Valid token, invalid body -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "email": "bad", "department": "" }

### 8. Unhandled exception -> 500 {"error":"Internal server error."} (Development only)
GET {{host}}/api/_debug/throw
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Exception without a token -> 401, never reaches the endpoint
GET {{host}}/api/_debug/throw

### 10. Swagger UI reachable without token (Development only)
GET {{host}}/swagger/index.html
